{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45134","headline":"奉陪杨使君顼送段校书赴南海幕 · 皎然","name":"奉陪杨使君顼送段校书赴南海幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"硕贤静广州，信爲天下贞。\n屈兹大将佐，藉彼延阁英。\n声动柳吴兴，郊饯意不轻。\n吾知段夫子，高论关苍生。\n处以得爲藩，出则道可行。\n遥知南楼会，新景当诗情。\n天高林瘴洗，秋远海色清。\n时泰罢飞檄，唯应颂公成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}